<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 3.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on July 3.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  July 3		 July 2</p>
<p>Fed acct			 3.544		  5.253</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  14.648		 34.000</p>
<p>Cash balance		  18.193		 39.253</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,269.584	     5,283.941</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $2 million were issued and $63 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
